The '''Echolocator''' is an {{Uncommon}} compass that points to the nearest {{MobSprite|Mega Bat}} which can spawn during the [[Spooky Festival]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
The '''Echolocator''' can be purchased from the {{NPCSprite|Fear Mongerer}} for {{Item|Green Candy|amount=32}} during the [[Spooky Festival]].

== Usage ==
During the [[Spooky Festival]], the '''Echolocator''' will point towards the nearest {{MobSprite|Mega Bat}}.

